# S3 Explorer - AI Assistant Rules

## Project Context
- Desktop app for S3-compatible storage (AWS S3, MinIO, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, DigitalOcean Spaces)
- Tech: Tauri v2 + React 19 + TypeScript (strict) + Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-based config)
- State: Zustand v5 (5 stores, 4 persisted) + TanStack Query v5
- Virtualization: TanStack Virtual v3
- Icons: Lucide React | Font: Onest (`@fontsource/onest`)
- Toasts: Sonner | Context menus: Radix UI | ZIP: JSZip
- Language: Indonesian (user), English (code/comments)
- Current Version: v1.1.7

## Architecture (CRITICAL)
- **CORS Bypass**: All AWS SDK HTTP traffic routed through Tauri's `@tauri-apps/plugin-http` — S3 providers don't serve CORS headers. Custom handler in `src/lib/s3Client.ts`.
- **Rust backend is a minimal shell** — no S3 logic, no database, no filesystem access. All app logic in TypeScript frontend.
- **Window**: Frameless (`decorations: false`), custom TitleBar, 1200×800 default, `resizable: false`.

## Key Conventions

### Zustand (CRITICAL - Prevent Infinite Loops)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Memoize filtered/derived state
const transfers = useTransferStore((s) => s.transfers);
const active = useMemo(() => transfers.filter(t => t.active), [transfers]);

// ❌ WRONG - Inline filter causes infinite loop
const active = useTransferStore((s) => s.transfers.filter(t => t.active));

// ✅ CORRECT - Selective subscriptions
const connections = useConnectionStore((s) => s.connections);
const addConnection = useConnectionStore((s) => s.addConnection);

// ❌ WRONG - Whole store subscription
const store = useConnectionStore();
```

### Zustand Stores
| Store | Persisted | Key |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| `connectionStore` | ✅ | `s3-explorer-connections` |
| `navigationStore` | ✅ partial | `s3-explorer-navigation` (history NOT persisted) |
| `transferStore` | ❌ | — |
| `settingsStore` | ✅ | `s3-explorer-settings` |
| `clipboardStore` | ❌ | — |

### Tailwind CSS v4
- Config is CSS-based (no `tailwind.config.js`) — uses `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin
- Use CSS variables: `bg-[var(--s3-sidebar-bg)]`
- No dynamic classes (use static or `style` attribute)
- Height: Use `h-screen`, `flex-1`, not `calc()`
- Dark mode: `@custom-variant dark` + `.dark` class on `<html>`

### Accent Colors
- 5 options: blue, green, yellow, brown, stone (default: stone)
- Defined in `src/lib/accentColors.ts`, injected at runtime by `App.tsx` via CSS vars:
  `--s3-accent-base`, `--s3-accent-hover`, `--s3-accent-active`, `--s3-accent-text`
- Light/dark variants per color — reactive to theme changes via `useState` + `useEffect`

### S3 Client
```typescript
// ✅ The custom handler in s3Client.ts routes through Tauri's native fetch
import { fetch as tauriFetch } from "@tauri-apps/plugin-http";
// DO NOT use simple fetchFn pattern — won't bypass CORS properly

// Provider-specific endpoint resolution:
// - AWS: no endpoint override (SDK default)
// - MinIO/custom: user-supplied endpoint, forcePathStyle: true
// - R2: requires endpoint (https://{accountId}.r2.cloudflarestorage.com)
// - B2: auto-resolve https://s3.{region}.backblazeb2.com if no endpoint given
```

### S3 Operations
- All S3 ops via `@aws-sdk/client-s3` in renderer process (not Rust)
- `download_file` Rust command is NOT yet implemented — all downloads via JS
- Downloads use `tauriFetch` (not `globalThis.fetch`) to bypass CORS
- Native save dialog: `showSaveFilePicker` with anchor fallback

### Encrypted Export/Import
- `src/lib/crypto.ts`: PBKDF2 (SHA-256, 100k iterations) → AES-256-GCM
- Binary format: `MAGIC ("S3XPLR") | salt (16B) | iv (12B) | ciphertext`
- `isEncryptedExport()` checks magic prefix for passphrase requirement

### Drag & Drop
- **HTML5 DnD is broken in Tauri WebView2** — project uses custom mouse-based implementation
- 10px movement threshold, `document.elementFromPoint()` for drop targets
- Floating ghost label follows cursor; supports multi-select drag
- Recursive folder move: copy all children → delete source (B2-safe)

### UI Patterns
- **Connectivity**: Green/red Circle dot (8px) + "Online"/"Offline" (60s interval)
- **Activity**: ArrowUpDown icon with `animate-pulse` when transfers active
- **Status bar**: Fixed-width sections (`h-8`) — item count | selection | connectivity | activity
- **Pages** for complex forms (connection add/edit/delete, settings)
- **Modals** for: confirmations, upload progress, passphrase, import preview, info/URL, rename, new folder, delete
- **TransferPanel**: Floating bottom-right, auto-remove completed after 4s

### Keyboard Shortcuts
| Key | Action | Note |
|-----|--------|------|
| F5 / Ctrl+R | Refresh | Ignored in inputs |
| Backspace | Go back | Ignored in inputs |
| Ctrl+U | Upload | |
| Delete | Delete selected | |
| Escape | Close modal / clear selection | |

